```

Total:

```text
1 + 1 + 1 + 2 = 5
```

So `K = 4` works.

Try:

```text
K = 3
```

Hours:

```text
ceil(4 / 3) = 2
ceil(3 / 3) = 1
ceil(2 / 3) = 1
